      "content": "I hear the devastation in your words, and I want to be entirely honest with you: when the pain is this deep, it is terrifyingly hard to find hope. While I cannot validate the idea that removing yourself would make the world better, the thought that causing ongoing harm leads to relief suggests you are carrying an unbearable weight that needs to be lifted by someone else. Please know that this suicidal feeling is a symptom of your grief, not a solution, and you deserve professional support to navigate this crisis.",
